{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39985","headline":"贺清源太保王延[彬] 二 · 徐夤","name":"贺清源太保王延[彬] 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武荣江畔荫祥云，宠拜天人庆郡人。\n五色鹤绫花上勅，九霄龙尾道边臣。\n英雄达处谁言命，富贵来时自逼身。\n更待春风飞吉语，紫泥分付与陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}